# Lockfile is per-machine. The Mac dev environment runs in Apple's
# Claude Code sandbox which proxies npm through `npm.apple.com`; a
# Mac-generated lockfile carries those URLs and is unreachable from
# Linux. Each machine generates its own; package.json is the
# cross-machine source of truth.
package-lock.json
